  await user.click(screen.getByRole("button", { name: /submit/i }));

  expect(
    await screen.findByText(/password is required/i)
  ).toBeInTheDocument();
});
```

## Two things worth checking before you finalize

1. **Is the error actually in the DOM, not just visually hidden?** If the component toggles `aria-invalid` / `aria-describedby` but mounts the error text conditionally, `findByText` still works. If it always renders the text and hides it with CSS, `findByText` will pass even when there's no error — in that case assert on `getByRole("alert")` or the `aria-invalid` attribute of the input instead:

   ```tsx
